ily:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"> June&#160;30, 2025, with decreases across all regions. Delivery Systems net sales were negatively impacted globally by unfavorable macroeconomic and credit conditions.</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-indent:18pt"><span style="color:#231f20;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Consumables net sales for the </span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">six months ended </span><span style="color:#231f20;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">June&#160;30, 2026 </span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">decreased</span><span style="color:#231f20;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"> </span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">$5.0 million</span><span style="color:#231f20;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">, or </span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">4.7%</span><span style="color:#231f20;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">, compared to the </span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">six months ended</span><span style="color:#231f20;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"> June&#160;30, 2025, with decreases across all regions, impacted by pressure on treatment volume and the transition to a distributor model in China in the prior year.</span></div><div style="height:45pt;position:relative;width:100%"><div style="bottom:0;position: